# dotfiles: lxpolkit (bin/x-autostart starts it in i3) kept out of Hyprland, where ostrov is the polkit agent
[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=LXPolKit
Comment=Policykit Authentication Agent
Exec=lxpolkit
TryExec=lxpolkit
Icon=gtk-dialog-authentication
NotShowIn=GNOME;KDE;MATE;LXQt;XFCE;Unity;X-Cinnamon;Hyprland;
NoDisplay=true
